1
00:01:32,740 --> 00:01:34,920
[OVERDO]

2
00:01:35,220 --> 00:01:37,810
[Episode 30]

3
00:01:39,789 --> 00:01:42,560
[Li Residence]

4
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:45,640
Li Boze?

5
00:01:46,479 --> 00:01:47,200
Li Boze!

6
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:51,710
Boze.

7
00:01:52,350 --> 00:01:53,350
The Zhang family

8
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:56,810
was behind
the North-South Railway bombing case

9
00:01:56,810 --> 00:01:58,280
19 years ago.

10
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,070
Although Marshal Li

11
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:04,490
participated in the plan at the time,

12
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:05,950
both sides agreed

13
00:02:06,070 --> 00:02:07,480
to only target Murong Feng

14
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,360
and seize control.

15
00:02:08,330 --> 00:02:10,060
[Nancheng Station]

16
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:16,960
However, it triggered a massive explosion,

17
00:02:17,630 --> 00:02:20,160
killing and injuring
hundreds of civilians.

18
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:23,130
This became a knot in the Marshal's heart.

19
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,190
Afterwards,

20
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,400
the reason given by the Zhang family

21
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:31,240
was that nearby explosives
were accidentally ignited.

22
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,300
It was an accident.

23
00:02:33,710 --> 00:02:34,910
But looking back now,

24
00:02:35,970 --> 00:02:39,190
the Zhang family was already backed by
the Chamber of Commerce back then.

25
00:02:39,190 --> 00:02:42,120
Their purpose was
to sabotage cooperation efforts.

26
00:02:42,829 --> 00:02:44,079
Also,

27
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,850
Master Fang's death 7 years ago

28
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:50,650
was caused by the Zhang family
and the Chamber of Commerce.

29
00:02:50,650 --> 00:02:51,860
Initially, the Chamber of Commerce

30
00:02:51,860 --> 00:02:54,720
wanted to conduct
Red Pill experiments in Nanyang.

31
00:02:55,030 --> 00:02:55,680
That batch of medicine

32
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:58,680
was secretly transported
by the Fang family's fleet.

33
00:02:59,150 --> 00:03:01,080
To protect the civilians on shore,

34
00:03:02,630 --> 00:03:05,160
Master Fang sank the ship
and killed himself.

35
00:03:08,110 --> 00:03:11,040
The Red Pill plan
was forcefully delayed for 7 years.

36
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:13,800
It means that the raw materials
for this medicine

37
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,200
are not that easy to find.

38
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,600
The Marshal said that

39
00:03:18,310 --> 00:03:20,510
if getting rid of this batch of Red Pills

40
00:03:21,500 --> 00:03:23,760
could delay progress by another 7 years,

41
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,130
it'd have been worth it.

42
00:03:30,310 --> 00:03:31,030
Boze,

43
00:03:31,850 --> 00:03:34,310
the Marshal asked me
to pass a message to you.

44
00:03:34,310 --> 00:03:35,310
The Marshal said,

45
00:03:36,770 --> 00:03:37,840
"Li Boze,

46
00:03:39,630 --> 00:03:41,470
a real man should die like me.

47
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:45,010
Don't make me look down on you."

48
00:04:13,510 --> 00:04:14,840
Is there anything else?

49
00:04:19,950 --> 00:04:20,600
Boze.

50
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,920
Ganging up to lie to me, huh?

51
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:36,600
Fine.

52
00:04:43,430 --> 00:04:44,070
Boze.

53
00:04:46,370 --> 00:04:48,570
You guys have been lying to me all along.

54
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:50,070
Every single

55
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,240
one of you

56
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:54,430
is a liar who abandoned me.

57
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:10,820
When I wanted to be a good police officer,

58
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:13,320
you lied to me
and told me to guard this home.

59
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:16,800
When I wanted to guard this home,

60
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:19,510
you started

61
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,980
talking to me about the greater good.

62
00:05:25,430 --> 00:05:26,870
Was it not you guys

63
00:05:27,190 --> 00:05:29,120
who preached it all to me?

64
00:05:33,190 --> 00:05:34,630
But in the end?

65
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,960
Everything became my fault.

66
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:42,360
I became the sinner
who showed no consideration.

67
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:46,480
Let me tell you all right now!

68
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:48,390
I!

69
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,270
Will walk down this path

70
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:53,560
to the very end.

71
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,530
I'm going to tell all of you that

72
00:05:57,390 --> 00:05:58,510
you are

73
00:05:59,070 --> 00:06:00,430
all wrong!

74
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,090
Out of my way.

75
00:06:10,260 --> 00:06:10,950
Boze!

76
00:06:10,950 --> 00:06:11,950
Young Master Qingyi.

77
00:06:11,950 --> 00:06:12,630
Let me go.

78
00:06:21,870 --> 00:06:22,680
Li Boze.

79
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:25,800
Li Boze!

80
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,000
This is your home.

81
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,360
Where are you going?

82
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,120
Home?

83
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,600
Does this home

84
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,870
still have my family?

85
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,070
You still have me.

86
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:43,480
It's been 7 years.

87
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,720
I've waited 7 years for you.

88
00:06:48,730 --> 00:06:50,390
I was waiting for you to tell me

89
00:06:50,790 --> 00:06:53,520
you'd let go of your prejudice
against my father,

90
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,930
and that you still had me

91
00:06:55,190 --> 00:06:56,750
in your heart!

92
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,920
But why are you saying it now?

93
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:01,780
Is it out of regret?

94
00:07:03,940 --> 00:07:04,830
Hai Tangqing.

95
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:07,800
Or is it out of pity?

96
00:07:08,390 --> 00:07:09,270
I admit it.

97
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:12,630
Li Rongzhang wasn't a heinous villain.

98
00:07:13,450 --> 00:07:15,190
But I wasn't wrong to hate him.

99
00:07:17,220 --> 00:07:19,550
Yes, you've been waiting all these years.

100
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:22,390
But did you think I had it easy?

101
00:07:22,390 --> 00:07:23,630
Yes, you're right.

102
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,680
Your brother is dead.

103
00:07:27,190 --> 00:07:28,600
And my father is dead too.

104
00:07:28,870 --> 00:07:29,870
We are

105
00:07:30,650 --> 00:07:31,920
even now.

106
00:07:32,750 --> 00:07:33,560
Li Boze!

107
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,000
When did I ever

108
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:46,000
truly belong to this family?

109
00:07:48,750 --> 00:07:49,630
This tree

110
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:53,020
was planted by my father
when Qingyi was a child.

111
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,040
After Qingyi left,

112
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:59,650
Father would often stand
under the tree and miss him.

113
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:03,360
I always thought I'd have a chance
to ask him

114
00:08:05,390 --> 00:08:07,070
when and why

115
00:08:07,310 --> 00:08:08,510
he planted this tree.

116
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,000
But now,

117
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,310
those unspoken words

118
00:08:16,390 --> 00:08:18,050
can never be brought up again.

119
00:08:21,870 --> 00:08:22,630
Boss Hai.

120
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:27,160
Our unspoken feelings

121
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:31,560
need not be brought up again either.

122
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:29,640
[Lanxin Theater]

123
00:09:33,150 --> 00:09:35,210
Luckily, you were just hit by debris.

124
00:09:35,510 --> 00:09:37,360
Otherwise, you'd have gotten
more than just a scratch.

125
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,160
It's nothing.

126
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:42,300
Good thing I was at the station today.

127
00:09:42,870 --> 00:09:43,530
Otherwise,

128
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,920
Li Boze might not have survived either.

129
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,000
Boze

130
00:09:57,030 --> 00:09:58,890
always wanted a complete family.

131
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,440
But now,

132
00:10:02,830 --> 00:10:05,760
everything that gave him
a sense of security and love

133
00:10:08,790 --> 00:10:09,870
is all gone.

134
00:10:13,330 --> 00:10:14,600
I can't even imagine

135
00:10:15,410 --> 00:10:16,870
how sad he must be.

136
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:23,910
He had warmth.

137
00:10:24,850 --> 00:10:25,910
But what about you?

138
00:10:44,650 --> 00:10:45,960
When I was little,

139
00:10:47,270 --> 00:10:48,930
I fantasized endlessly about

140
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:50,740
Li Rongzhang's death.

141
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,120
But today,

142
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:56,270
I didn't even dare

143
00:10:57,350 --> 00:10:59,000
to see his body.

144
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:04,960
This man

145
00:11:06,550 --> 00:11:08,750
was a violent father on one hand,

146
00:11:10,030 --> 00:11:12,230
and a martyr for his nation on the other.

147
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:14,790
His ambition led to mistakes,

148
00:11:15,510 --> 00:11:17,960
but he stepped up when he realized them.

149
00:11:19,030 --> 00:11:19,880
Looking back now,

150
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:22,150
maybe we never truly understood him.

151
00:11:23,750 --> 00:11:25,200
So I don't know

152
00:11:25,670 --> 00:11:26,930
whether I should laugh

153
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:27,720
or cry.

154
00:11:30,150 --> 00:11:31,000
Do you think

155
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:35,730
Li Rongzhang ever regretted
how he treated me

156
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,620
and my adoptive mother

157
00:11:37,910 --> 00:11:39,640
in the last moments of his life?

158
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,130
Get some good sleep.

159
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,410
Maybe he'll tell you in your dream.

160
00:11:56,550 --> 00:11:58,080
I hope it's not a nightmare.

161
00:12:27,510 --> 00:12:28,910
What game is this?

162
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:29,960
What is this?

163
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:31,020
What game, you ask?

164
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,430
A horse-carry.

165
00:12:32,450 --> 00:12:33,200
Is it high?

166
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:34,440
Is it?

167
00:12:34,550 --> 00:12:35,150
Is it high?

168
00:12:35,270 --> 00:12:35,750
Yes.

169
00:12:36,550 --> 00:12:38,030
When you grow up,
you can ride a real horse.

170
00:12:38,030 --> 00:12:38,630
Okay?

171
00:12:38,630 --> 00:12:39,120
Okay.

172
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,320
Daddy will buy you a horse to ride.

173
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:41,960
Okay?

174
00:12:42,670 --> 00:12:43,670
Ride a horse into battle.

175
00:12:43,670 --> 00:12:44,840
Join the battlefield,

176
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,270
okay?

177
00:12:45,270 --> 00:12:45,960
Okay.

178
00:12:50,550 --> 00:12:51,600
Mommy is here.

179
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,210
Make room for Mommy.

180
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:55,600
Sit over here.

181
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,670
Hold it carefully.

182
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:58,720
-Be careful.
-Give it a hug.

183
00:12:58,720 --> 00:12:59,150
So nice.

184
00:12:59,150 --> 00:12:59,910
Look at its little nose.

185
00:12:59,910 --> 00:13:01,150
Pet it.

186
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:02,320
Give a hug.

187
00:13:03,150 --> 00:13:03,960
So nice.

188
00:14:03,630 --> 00:14:05,490
We noticed it early this morning.

189
00:14:06,170 --> 00:14:07,300
In just one morning,

190
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:09,550
he started becoming delirious.

191
00:14:09,860 --> 00:14:11,290
The disease progresses extremely fast.

192
00:14:11,290 --> 00:14:12,080
At first,

193
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:14,630
we thought it was just a fever
caused by a wound infection,

194
00:14:14,630 --> 00:14:17,090
but all common medicines
are useless on him.

195
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:18,840
What's worse,

196
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,550
other students in the aviation school

197
00:14:20,550 --> 00:14:22,810
have started showing the same symptoms.

198
00:14:23,030 --> 00:14:26,360
They are exactly the same
as the symptoms Mr. Bao described.

199
00:14:31,550 --> 00:14:32,670
Lock down the school.

200
00:14:32,670 --> 00:14:33,330
From now on,

201
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,720
no one is allowed in or out.

202
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:35,270
Yes.

203
00:14:43,690 --> 00:14:44,950
Here, spray more here.

204
00:14:46,510 --> 00:14:47,970
Here, sprinkle more here.

205
00:14:48,030 --> 00:14:49,230
Don't miss this spot.

206
00:14:50,870 --> 00:14:51,400
And here,

207
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:52,010
watch it.

208
00:15:01,150 --> 00:15:02,980
[Regulations for the Use
and Transportation of RDX Explosives]

209
00:15:07,390 --> 00:15:08,000
Wasn't this batch of Red Pills

210
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,600
already destroyed?

211
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:12,500
Why are there still infection symptoms?

212
00:15:14,550 --> 00:15:16,350
Could there be some left behind?

213
00:15:21,270 --> 00:15:22,000
Impossible.

214
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:25,320
The aviation school students
couldn't have used the Red Pills.

215
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,630
This batch of infections

216
00:15:26,630 --> 00:15:28,690
was not spread through the Red Pills.

217
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:30,600
Did you ask

218
00:15:30,630 --> 00:15:32,870
what else the students
have been in contact with?

219
00:15:32,870 --> 00:15:34,240
We have already tested

220
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:36,240
all possible sources of infection.

221
00:15:36,870 --> 00:15:38,130
It must be due to either

222
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:39,240
oral medicine,

223
00:15:39,510 --> 00:15:40,320
food,

224
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:41,800
water sources, or...

225
00:15:44,150 --> 00:15:44,790
Come in.

226
00:15:48,550 --> 00:15:49,200
Principal,

227
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:50,600
the test results are out.

228
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,360
It's the water tank.

229
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,670
The water storage tank
of the aviation school

230
00:15:53,670 --> 00:15:56,070
has an excessive dose of unknown bacteria.

231
00:15:59,510 --> 00:16:00,080
Got it.

232
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:00,880
You may leave.

233
00:16:03,750 --> 00:16:04,390
Water tank?

234
00:16:04,390 --> 00:16:06,510
The entire school
uses this water tank.

235
00:16:06,510 --> 00:16:09,570
Who knows how many teachers
and students are infected?

236
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:21,420
This thing has an incubation period.

237
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:23,000
Right now,

238
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:25,030
it has only just begun.

239
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:47,640
What's Zhang Mingshu thinking?

240
00:16:48,670 --> 00:16:50,600
How dare he poison the military camp?

241
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:51,720
I heard that at the aviation school,

242
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:53,480
students are also getting sick.

243
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:55,320
It seems the Zhang family
wants to use bacteria

244
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:57,120
to wipe out
the military's effective strength

245
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:58,650
and then control Nancheng.

246
00:17:01,150 --> 00:17:02,750
Lock down the military camp.

247
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:04,750
Screen all patients with symptoms

248
00:17:04,750 --> 00:17:06,410
and isolate them separately.

249
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:07,810
Commander Tang.

250
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:08,440
Liu Zhou.

251
00:17:09,310 --> 00:17:10,480
From now on,

252
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,060
including myself,

253
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:13,440
everyone

254
00:17:13,550 --> 00:17:15,810
is forbidden to leave the military camp.

255
00:17:15,829 --> 00:17:16,349
Yes.

256
00:17:36,550 --> 00:17:37,720
I have sent a message

257
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:39,550
to Murong Qingyi and Li Boze.

258
00:17:40,310 --> 00:17:41,840
There is only one antidote.

259
00:17:42,350 --> 00:17:45,160
Whoever cooperates with
the East Asia Chamber of Commerce first

260
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:47,000
will get the antidote.

261
00:17:47,310 --> 00:17:48,570
As for the other party,

262
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:50,200
our hands are tied.

263
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:55,550
The bait has been dropped.

264
00:17:55,790 --> 00:17:57,070
The angler

265
00:17:57,160 --> 00:18:00,160
just needs to wait patiently
for the fish to bite.

266
00:18:02,070 --> 00:18:03,310
This way,

267
00:18:04,030 --> 00:18:07,690
we can completely drive a wedge
between Murong Qingyi and Li Boze,

268
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:11,070
and also weaken the forces
of the Ying Army and the aviation school.

269
00:18:11,070 --> 00:18:12,670
A brilliant move, Chairman.

270
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:18,480
At first, I thought that kid
from the Murong family

271
00:18:18,830 --> 00:18:21,880
was highly capable.

272
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:25,200
But even now, he doesn't know

273
00:18:25,310 --> 00:18:26,440
that the

274
00:18:26,550 --> 00:18:29,920
addictive Red Pills sold in the market

275
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:32,150
are nothing but

276
00:18:32,150 --> 00:18:35,310
crudely made opium.

277
00:18:35,790 --> 00:18:38,590
Making opium into the shape of red pills.

278
00:18:39,830 --> 00:18:41,720
Chairman, your little trick

279
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:43,590
has completely fooled them.

280
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:45,970
Little do they know that

281
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:48,640
only the batch sent to the train station

282
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:50,270
is the real deadly weapon.

283
00:18:51,110 --> 00:18:52,510
It can be secretly

284
00:18:52,510 --> 00:18:55,310
mixed with regular Red Pills
and enter the market.

285
00:18:55,510 --> 00:18:57,030
Seven years ago,

286
00:18:57,960 --> 00:19:00,220
that batch of disease-causing Red Pills

287
00:19:00,510 --> 00:19:02,910
was completely destroyed by Fang Youshen.

288
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,400
It took us a lot of effort

289
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:07,920
to develop the new batch.

290
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:10,790
But before it even left the train station,

291
00:19:10,790 --> 00:19:13,550
it was blown to pieces
by that old bastard,

292
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:15,680
Li Rongzhang.

293
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:17,350
Now,

294
00:19:17,830 --> 00:19:21,350
we can only use the remaining
original reagents.

295
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:22,920
One gram of this

296
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:25,000
is equivalent to

297
00:19:25,310 --> 00:19:27,840
hundreds of pounds
of the previous Red Pills.

298
00:19:28,880 --> 00:19:32,000
The original reagent is unstable
and sensitive to high temperatures.

299
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:34,880
It must be transported
and stored properly.

300
00:19:35,720 --> 00:19:36,640
This time,

301
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:40,350
we can't afford any more mistakes.

302
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:43,560
Rest assured, Chairman.

303
00:19:44,240 --> 00:19:46,440
Nothing will go wrong this time.

304
00:20:20,350 --> 00:20:22,240
Patients initially develop
fever and blisters,

305
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:24,240
accompanied by local wound ulceration.

306
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:25,040
At this stage,

307
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,680
there is a risk of infection
through mucosal

308
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:27,740
and blood contact.

309
00:20:28,070 --> 00:20:29,880
Fortunately, it's controllable.

310
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:32,110
Ensure you disinfect
after contacting patients.

311
00:20:32,110 --> 00:20:32,960
Their wounds

312
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:34,510
will gradually become
unbearably itchy and painful.

313
00:20:34,510 --> 00:20:36,310
Patients will inevitably
struggle and scratch,

314
00:20:36,310 --> 00:20:37,710
which hinders scabbing.

315
00:20:38,270 --> 00:20:39,070
At this stage,

316
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:40,160
the patients' consciousness

317
00:20:40,160 --> 00:20:41,270
will alternate between

318
00:20:41,270 --> 00:20:42,680
confusion and lucidity.

319
00:20:43,820 --> 00:20:45,050
The longer the disease progresses,

320
00:20:45,050 --> 00:20:47,200
the longer
the periods of confusion will last,

321
00:20:47,200 --> 00:20:48,160
until death.

322
00:20:48,790 --> 00:20:49,680
Currently,

323
00:20:50,270 --> 00:20:52,200
we have no effective drugs to control it.

324
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:54,680
We can only isolate them
and reduce their temperature.

325
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:56,510
As long as body temperature
is well controlled,

326
00:20:56,510 --> 00:20:57,550
it can shorten

327
00:20:57,720 --> 00:20:59,180
the duration of the onset.

328
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:02,200
Whether they survive

329
00:21:03,240 --> 00:21:05,370
depends on their physical condition.

330
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:11,550
Come hold him down!

331
00:21:11,550 --> 00:21:12,200
Hurry!

332
00:21:32,470 --> 00:21:33,200
Hurry.

333
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:34,660
Isolate all the patients!

334
00:21:36,240 --> 00:21:37,480
All items used by the patients

335
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:38,540
must be taken away!

336
00:21:41,070 --> 00:21:42,030
Take these clothes and bedsheets

337
00:21:42,030 --> 00:21:43,200
away for disinfection!

338
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:45,800
All blood-stained clothes
must be destroyed!

339
00:22:09,720 --> 00:22:12,520
This patient's temperature
has finally dropped.

340
00:22:27,270 --> 00:22:28,200
His temperature

341
00:22:28,350 --> 00:22:30,410
hasn't dropped for over half an hour.

342
00:22:30,480 --> 00:22:32,510
We need someone here for
physical cooling immediately.

343
00:22:32,510 --> 00:22:33,110
Okay.

344
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:35,030
Let's go.

345
00:22:40,200 --> 00:22:41,000
It hurts.

346
00:22:41,900 --> 00:22:42,990
It hurts.

347
00:22:43,350 --> 00:22:44,480
It hurts.

348
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:48,310
It's itchy.

349
00:22:48,310 --> 00:22:49,040
I'm so itchy.

350
00:23:09,000 --> 00:23:09,860
Young Marshal.

351
00:23:10,400 --> 00:23:11,930
You haven't eaten for days.

352
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:15,800
Have something to eat first.

353
00:23:17,880 --> 00:23:18,510
Thank you.

354
00:23:20,510 --> 00:23:21,110
By the way.

355
00:23:22,790 --> 00:23:23,550
Today,

356
00:23:25,590 --> 00:23:27,650
how many new patients were admitted?

357
00:23:29,110 --> 00:23:30,310
Twenty-three cases.

358
00:23:34,760 --> 00:23:36,270
It's so itchy.

359
00:23:37,030 --> 00:23:38,550
Is this the limit?

360
00:23:39,750 --> 00:23:41,350
Pardon? I didn't catch that.

361
00:23:47,270 --> 00:23:48,000
I said,

362
00:23:48,520 --> 00:23:50,850
there will only be more and more patients.

363
00:23:52,950 --> 00:23:54,610
We'll be busy for a long while.

364
00:23:57,030 --> 00:23:58,630
-Go to bed early.
-It itches.

365
00:24:06,790 --> 00:24:07,680
It's itchy.

366
00:24:19,790 --> 00:24:20,680
When a patient's coma

367
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:22,200
exceeds 45 minutes,

368
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:24,080
he reaches a critical point.

369
00:24:26,240 --> 00:24:28,170
If the fever is not reduced in time,

370
00:24:28,830 --> 00:24:29,890
he will very likely

371
00:24:31,310 --> 00:24:32,470
never wake up again.

372
00:24:48,830 --> 00:24:49,890
Bury him properly.

373
00:25:24,240 --> 00:25:25,790
This is the first death.

374
00:25:27,550 --> 00:25:29,080
It's only been 8 short days.

375
00:25:32,030 --> 00:25:33,000
In these 8 days,

376
00:25:33,830 --> 00:25:35,690
you haven't wasted even a second.

377
00:25:36,750 --> 00:25:39,350
We figured out the course of
this strange disease so quickly

378
00:25:39,350 --> 00:25:40,200
thanks to you.

379
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:42,240
Don't be so hard on yourself,

380
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:42,880
Qingyi.

381
00:25:46,030 --> 00:25:48,290
I was the one who rejected Zhang Mingshu.

382
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:50,920
But the price was paid

383
00:25:51,920 --> 00:25:54,650
by the innocent students
of the aviation school.

384
00:25:55,510 --> 00:25:56,970
I don't care about myself,

385
00:25:58,880 --> 00:26:00,070
but I have no right

386
00:26:00,270 --> 00:26:01,800
to make decisions for them.

387
00:26:07,160 --> 00:26:08,480
I met someone today.

388
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:11,660
It was quite the coincidence.

389
00:26:12,200 --> 00:26:13,110
Guess who?

390
00:26:19,370 --> 00:26:21,100
Back in the Huo family's vault,

391
00:26:21,550 --> 00:26:24,070
among the girls
who fought their way out with us,

392
00:26:24,070 --> 00:26:25,600
there was one named Zhaodi.

393
00:26:26,750 --> 00:26:28,350
Ms. Ye changed her name.

394
00:26:28,640 --> 00:26:29,920
Encouraged by Ms. Ye,

395
00:26:30,510 --> 00:26:32,370
she got into the aviation school.

396
00:26:34,510 --> 00:26:35,710
She wasn't infected,

397
00:26:38,640 --> 00:26:40,300
but she was badly frightened.

398
00:26:43,270 --> 00:26:45,270
Yet she still refuses to leave here.

399
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:49,400
She said her father sold her
to the Huo family,

400
00:26:49,400 --> 00:26:50,860
and she almost died there.

401
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:53,500
Getting into the aviation school

402
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:56,610
is something she'll never regret.

403
00:26:59,920 --> 00:27:01,720
She also asked me to tell you that

404
00:27:04,110 --> 00:27:06,040
she thinks you did the right thing.

405
00:27:08,440 --> 00:27:09,480
Even if we die,

406
00:27:10,750 --> 00:27:12,610
we will never betray our country.

407
00:27:24,030 --> 00:27:24,960
Thank you.

408
00:27:25,680 --> 00:27:26,960
I'm fine, don't worry.

409
00:27:27,310 --> 00:27:28,160
Go back first.

410
00:27:28,680 --> 00:27:30,280
I want to be alone for a while.

411
00:27:34,160 --> 00:27:35,240
Rest early.

412
00:27:36,640 --> 00:27:39,650
Everything in the aviation school
still depends on you.

413
00:27:39,650 --> 00:27:40,510
Don't worry.

414
00:28:16,560 --> 00:28:19,120
[Isolation Room]

415
00:28:22,270 --> 00:28:23,160
Good work.

416
00:28:24,200 --> 00:28:31,800
[Isolation Room]

417
00:28:25,030 --> 00:28:26,070
Where is the principal?

418
00:28:26,070 --> 00:28:26,600
Oh, yeah.

419
00:28:26,640 --> 00:28:29,350
The principal usually stays here all day.

420
00:28:30,350 --> 00:28:32,150
I haven't seen him today either.

421
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:38,720
Dr. Lin,

422
00:28:39,160 --> 00:28:40,920
prepare another isolation room.

423
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:42,830
If the first batch of sick students
shows improvement,

424
00:28:42,830 --> 00:28:44,350
transfer them immediately.

425
00:28:44,350 --> 00:28:46,880
They must be separated
from the severe cases.

426
00:28:48,310 --> 00:28:50,910
We don't know how long
this incident will last.

427
00:28:51,720 --> 00:28:52,440
Ms. Ye,

428
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:53,960
supplies in the aviation school

429
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:55,000
must be provided uniformly

430
00:28:55,000 --> 00:28:57,000
and allocated to the patients first.

431
00:28:57,000 --> 00:28:57,800
Rest assured.

432
00:28:59,270 --> 00:29:01,130
Even if the principal is not here,

433
00:29:01,590 --> 00:29:02,980
the aviation school cannot be in chaos.

434
00:29:02,980 --> 00:29:07,610
[Isolation Room]

435
00:29:51,680 --> 00:29:53,030
[5:30 p.m.]

436
00:29:55,960 --> 00:29:58,630
[5:30 p.m: Felt a foreign object
in my throat]

437
00:30:09,920 --> 00:30:10,550
Qingyi.

438
00:30:11,880 --> 00:30:13,000
Open the door, Qingyi.

439
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:14,260
I know you're in there.

440
00:30:14,960 --> 00:30:15,750
I'm fine.

441
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:17,010
Go back to your work.

442
00:30:17,270 --> 00:30:18,470
Don't try to lie to me.

443
00:30:19,070 --> 00:30:20,270
Are you infected too?

444
00:30:21,110 --> 00:30:21,480
Open the door!

445
00:30:21,480 --> 00:30:23,140
I told you I'm fine. Leave now!

446
00:30:54,510 --> 00:30:55,440
You have a fever.

447
00:30:57,030 --> 00:30:59,590
How can you control your
temperature by yourself in here?

448
00:30:59,590 --> 00:31:01,680
You'll die faster
if you coop yourself up here.

449
00:31:01,680 --> 00:31:02,510
Listen to me.

450
00:31:06,270 --> 00:31:07,590
If they find out

451
00:31:08,650 --> 00:31:09,990
that I'm infected,

452
00:31:11,070 --> 00:31:12,600
it will shake their morale.

453
00:31:14,240 --> 00:31:15,680
If I really get sick,

454
00:31:17,750 --> 00:31:19,240
you must lock me up.

455
00:31:22,550 --> 00:31:24,750
You absolutely cannot let anyone know.

456
00:32:27,480 --> 00:32:29,140
Day 2 since Qingyi's illness.

457
00:32:29,640 --> 00:32:31,570
He started losing consciousness.

458
00:32:33,830 --> 00:32:36,750
The number of deaths in the school
keeps increasing.

459
00:32:36,750 --> 00:32:37,750
No one knows

460
00:32:38,310 --> 00:32:39,750
who will be next.

461
00:33:10,760 --> 00:33:12,600
♪ I happened to ♪

462
00:33:12,620 --> 00:33:14,370
♪ Hear your name ♪

463
00:33:13,880 --> 00:33:15,840
Snow fell before the
beginning of Winter,

464
00:33:15,840 --> 00:33:17,690
♪ And all the memories ♪

465
00:33:16,750 --> 00:33:18,440
hinting that this year's winter

466
00:33:17,710 --> 00:33:20,720
♪ Came flooding back ♪

467
00:33:18,880 --> 00:33:20,000
would be very long.

468
00:33:21,500 --> 00:33:23,360
♪ There I stood in the falling snow ♪

469
00:33:21,920 --> 00:33:24,640
Yet I secretly rejoiced
at the snow's arrival.

470
00:33:23,380 --> 00:33:25,830
♪ Wrapped in my coat ♪

471
00:33:26,390 --> 00:33:28,610
♪ My heart pounding ♪

472
00:33:29,960 --> 00:33:31,550
Day 4 since Qingyi's illness.

473
00:33:30,780 --> 00:33:32,780
♪ Walking down that old road ♪

474
00:33:32,400 --> 00:33:34,480
His coma lasted for half an hour.

475
00:33:32,800 --> 00:33:34,660
♪ Stopping every few steps ♪

476
00:33:35,990 --> 00:33:37,810
♪ In the misty train car ♪

477
00:33:36,030 --> 00:33:37,830
Every time he lost consciousness,

478
00:33:37,830 --> 00:33:41,510
♪ I wish I could ask you once more ♪

479
00:33:39,270 --> 00:33:41,550
I didn't know if he would wake up.

480
00:33:42,370 --> 00:33:46,390
♪ If you have any ♪

481
00:33:46,480 --> 00:33:48,710
♪ New corny jokes to tell ♪

482
00:33:48,680 --> 00:33:49,310
Qingyi!

483
00:33:49,720 --> 00:33:50,270
Qingyi!

484
00:33:50,790 --> 00:33:51,960
I heard from Ms. Ye that

485
00:33:51,650 --> 00:33:54,350
♪ Memories are like falling into a trap ♪

486
00:33:52,750 --> 00:33:54,680
some students survived the onset phase

487
00:33:54,380 --> 00:33:56,580
♪ Full of mud ♪

488
00:33:54,830 --> 00:33:56,610
and their temperatures returned to normal.

489
00:33:56,610 --> 00:33:58,530
♪ The more I struggle,
the more suffocated I become ♪

490
00:33:57,960 --> 00:33:59,640
I've never prayed for anything.

491
00:33:58,920 --> 00:34:01,760
♪ But I couldn't resist collecting them ♪

492
00:34:00,310 --> 00:34:01,370
But at this moment,

493
00:34:01,920 --> 00:34:04,330
♪ I keep collecting ♪

494
00:34:02,240 --> 00:34:03,880
I hope such good luck

495
00:34:04,460 --> 00:34:07,280
♪ Every word and comment ♪

496
00:34:04,960 --> 00:34:07,030
can fall upon Qingyi too.

497
00:34:07,310 --> 00:34:09,340
♪ They speak of you ♪

498
00:34:09,429 --> 00:34:11,860
♪ You are so clear ♪

499
00:34:11,980 --> 00:34:14,130
♪ So close and so clear ♪

500
00:34:14,570 --> 00:34:16,929
♪ If you possibly ♪

501
00:34:17,010 --> 00:34:19,210
♪ Still have the courage ♪

502
00:34:19,290 --> 00:34:24,520
♪ Then take me away from here ♪

503
00:34:25,650 --> 00:34:27,770
♪ Please stop doubting ♪

504
00:34:27,790 --> 00:34:31,719
♪ My determination to run away with you ♪

505
00:34:27,840 --> 00:34:28,510
Qingyi.

506
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:34,460
