507
00:34:35,280 --> 00:34:36,540
I won't eat. Leave now.

508
00:34:37,230 --> 00:34:37,760
Here.

509
00:36:10,410 --> 00:36:11,550
You can't sleep.

510
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:13,290
You can't sleep!

511
00:36:14,320 --> 00:36:16,630
If the coma exceeds 45 minutes...

512
00:36:27,530 --> 00:36:28,800
Murong Qingyi.

513
00:36:30,320 --> 00:36:32,360
You finally have a family.

514
00:36:33,230 --> 00:36:34,110
Li Rongzhang.

515
00:36:34,390 --> 00:36:36,480
A general's success
is built on a thousand skulls,

516
00:36:36,480 --> 00:36:37,740
don't you understand?

517
00:36:39,480 --> 00:36:41,800
You must hold on.

518
00:36:44,280 --> 00:36:45,110
I said,

519
00:36:45,630 --> 00:36:47,480
I only want Murong Feng's life.

520
00:36:58,630 --> 00:36:59,430
Open the door.

521
00:36:59,590 --> 00:37:00,510
Open the door!

522
00:37:00,510 --> 00:37:01,440
Hurry!

523
00:37:03,030 --> 00:37:03,880
Kid,

524
00:37:04,190 --> 00:37:06,190
trying to tip off the Murong family?

525
00:37:07,430 --> 00:37:08,760
You're courting death.

526
00:37:11,480 --> 00:37:12,410
Assassination?

527
00:37:13,190 --> 00:37:14,590
Why should I believe you?

528
00:37:15,280 --> 00:37:17,140
You can't even speak coherently.

529
00:37:17,590 --> 00:37:19,230
Who wants to kill your father?

530
00:37:19,230 --> 00:37:19,960
Where?

531
00:37:20,440 --> 00:37:21,190
Tell me.

532
00:37:23,840 --> 00:37:24,760
I don't know.

533
00:37:25,480 --> 00:37:26,400
It hurts...

534
00:37:27,190 --> 00:37:27,960
Mother,

535
00:37:28,590 --> 00:37:29,650
please believe me.

536
00:37:30,150 --> 00:37:30,880
Mother,

537
00:37:31,480 --> 00:37:32,280
don't go...

538
00:37:53,150 --> 00:37:53,880
Qingyi!

539
00:37:54,480 --> 00:37:55,030
Qingyi!

540
00:38:03,280 --> 00:38:05,080
Your temperature has gone down.

541
00:38:06,920 --> 00:38:08,230
We made it through.

542
00:38:09,320 --> 00:38:10,800
We will be fine now.

543
00:38:13,230 --> 00:38:14,480
We will be fine now.
